cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its accompanying proofs, please cite this release."
title: "Paired Restrictions and a Gate Lower Bound for Directed Hamiltonian Cycle"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: ll3me
    website: "https://github.com/ll3me"
version: "0.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ll3me/mobius-lean"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Research software and proof notes on directed Hamiltonian cycle detection
  by Boolean circuits with binary AND and OR gates, unary NOT gates, and
  unrestricted sharing. The notes derive a gate lower bound of
  (11/7)n(n-1) - 3n - 4 by restricting pairs of vertices. Lean 4 checks
  counting implications and the size induction. Python programs exercise
  the graph constructions and gate counts on finite instances.
